abstract: |
  This repository contains the source-available Lean 4 companion artifact for
  three manuscripts by Moses Rahnama: "The Orientation Boundary for
  Step-Duplicating Recursors: Direct Measures, Polynomial Decision, and
  Dependency-Pair Escape," "Observer Determinacy of Termination Certificates: Sufficient
  Statistics, Blackwell Comparison, and Simple Projections for Step-Duplicating
  Recursion," and "Unique
  Normal Forms: Proof-Graph Counterexamples, Infinite-Carrier Certificates, and
  Confluence Repair."

  This package contains the Lean 4 modules named by those manuscripts or
  required to compile them, the TTT2 and CeTA artifacts, and the three
  claim-to-code indexes.
